abstract: >-
  Pathogen-side analysis of Fusarium thapsinum RNA in a public sorghum
  QuantSeq experiment. The workflow separates RNA-derived burden from
  relative transcript allocation and includes complete-family promoter
  testing and explicitly labelled exploratory motif follow-up.
keywords:
  - Fusarium thapsinum
  - sorghum
  - pathogen transcriptomics
  - brown midrib
  - promoter motif
